[logic-map] cannot derive modified Go functions: landing point e9355a821010 precedes the evidence that pins it (1413f175f99a): a declared landing cannot be older than the commit that put this change's evidence into the history — to move a record the evidence has outgrown: refresh the bundles, remove `landed-commit.txt` in a commit, then run `--record-landing` again (a record is never overwritten, so the value it had stays in the history)
